description:
Keira Riff’s Watch History is finally here and it’s generating a ton of buzz (and not just because of the video she uses for fly sound effects). 

She also shares the video her whole family swears by to clear water out of their phones, the Brazilian Creators that have inspired her YouTube Journey (looking at you, Kefera!), and even how she’s still in the honeymoon phase of her relationship with her boyfriend. Her Watch History is as hilarious and random as Keira herself is.

